  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1502.09 \"Temporary employee\" means “temporary employee” as defined in RSA 277-B:2, VII, namely “an individual hired to perform temporary help service.”\n\nSource. #13440, eff 8-24-22 (formerly Lab 1502.08)",
